          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مصاب (muṣāb) is built on the native Arabic root ṣ-w-b, \"to hit the mark\" (Lane). Muṣāb is the Form IV passive participle, \"struck, hit\", hence \"injured\"."
